+    *   $T$: Tensor of shape $(J, F, 3)$ storing translation vectors $T_j^t$.
+*   **Group Assignment:** An array of shape $(N)$ mapping each Gaussian index $i$ to a group index $j \in \{0, \dots, J-1\}$.
